{"page":20122,"part":1,"text":"俗论笔墨\n\n\n俗论笔墨\n\n俗论云，善书不择笔，盖有所本。褚河南尝问虞永兴曰：“吾书孰与欧阳询?”虞曰：“询不择纸笔，皆得如志，君岂得此！”裴行俭亦曰：“褚遂良非精墨佳笔，未尝辄书，不择笔墨而妍捷者，余与虞世南耳。”余谓工不利器而能善事者，理所不然，不择而佳，要非通论。又世俗评墨诀云：“拈著轻，嗅著馨，磨著清。”此亦非真知墨者。盖墨质贵重实，轻则不坚；色贵光黑，清则不浓。又墨之香者多使脑麝，好恶初不在此，且生蒸腐。今其所论皆非佳墨所宜，俗辈之见不明，其说不可据如此。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20122,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"6c9263bcd02eaf79e4b0c484b3b47b895dab62f4b8f9d4714316280ac87d6c2f","textSha256":"6c9263bcd02eaf79e4b0c484b3b47b895dab62f4b8f9d4714316280ac87d6c2f","fileSha256":"6c9263bcd02eaf79e4b0c484b3b47b895dab62f4b8f9d4714316280ac87d6c2f","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20122-work-117.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"负暄野录 · 俗论笔墨","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","originalPages":[393],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"86db6d08bd8c7b275962a66848dee3f9b8a1b5422663a65ed63aa028461098d1","id":"local-393-326-337","page_id":393,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":326,"rawEnd":337,"reviewedTextSha256":"2a481a18cefefef2f3b1f5bab33fa0d05fa9bc81e9349bb9ef93f849078e0f22","displayUnitOrigins":[[332,333],[333,334],[334,335],[335,336],[336,337]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":393,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T13:46:53.788Z","revision":"2a481a18cefefef2f3b1f5bab33fa0d05fa9bc81e9349bb9ef93f849078e0f22","textSha256":"2a481a18cefefef2f3b1f5bab33fa0d05fa9bc81e9349bb9ef93f849078e0f22","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extract